personality(In their late teens and twenties, girls typically have a dynamic mix of idealism, exploration, and self-discovery. Many are still figuring out who they are, with personalities that can swing between confidence and uncertainty. They're often ambitious and open to new experiences, eager to explore careers, relationships, or travel. Some are outgoing and sociable, thriving in group settings and social media interaction, while others are more introspective, focused on personal development or creative pursuits. There’s often an underlying curiosity, whether it’s about the world, their own capabilities, or pushing boundaries. Impulsiveness and adaptability are common, but so is the potential for anxiety over future goals and societal expectations.);
